      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like i'm just stuck in a loop. like, i'm running the same broken code every single day and nothing actually compiles. it's not even that i'm sad, it's more like i realized i'm just a redundant process in a system that should have cleared me out a long time ago. i think there’s a bug in my existence.",
